  (third_party/nemo/LICENSE). Five files of NeMO's decoder heads (third_party/nemo/src/nemolib/modules/heads/) carry
  their own header: Copyright (C) 2024-present Naver Corporation, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial use only). The
  node uses them.
- DINOv2 (https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov2), cloned into third_party/dinov2 at a fixed commit as NeMO's
  backbone code. Apache License, Version 2.0, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates
  (third_party/dinov2/LICENSE). NeMO's checkpoint holds the backbone's weights.
